            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJc5BKyCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAJTBJ8R2o4T3H3tlhZxWQOY1\nCCWHepFhCbHWE0O2PJ7A1A6oIHUeMX/HXjUp1Rjo0+XqYnzVZNYBA5eL/D4ZavZa\nkLXd1h8p5LDowOpzF/MT71J4oMVdeGy5ZI0djsPjqDUR4bRINUoo6gvtdypiGWak\nviXxLEKcwfb/kU25m05DjPhYg36Qp40gOui/b+b2n6bEQ3pyLHDnMPe9MvcvRPfy\nhIwX4wFvhT59vIXp0Fu+VvIKpuOs4Ta5HOL01DGo/vEBtLLRGwZK4I01o201IsiB\nnvDwg1jfcP6uQKHIsSkR23yw+l9surp4Q0e5NQ4MvXeKQvOBj8eRHLopMIF9l94=\n=4xn5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 927b7aca8e0e2495a64ffc02f6aa087f98159806\nparent d42dda1525b783051ec3bc465a2915bfb564da39\nauthor Long Ho <longlho@users.noreply.github.com> 1558450866 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1558450866 -0400\n\nConvert more tests to TS, rm cldr build step (#190)\n\n* Convert more tests to TS, rm cldr build step\r\n\r\n- Fix browser tests\r\n- Remove cldr step since we can use Intl.PluralRules.supportedLocalesOf()\r\n\r\nBefore switching to Intl.NumberFormat.supportedLocalesOf():\r\n/m/c/s/intl-messageformat ❯❯❯ npm run benchmark\r\n\r\n> intl-messageformat@3.0.0 benchmark /mnt/c/src/intl-messageformat\r\n> ts-node --project tsconfig.all.json tests/benchmark\r\n\r\nformat_cached_complex_msg x 385,250 ops/sec ±0.62% (90 runs sampled)\r\nformat_cached_string_msg x 100,322,485 ops/sec ±6.66% (83 runs sampled)\r\nnew_complex_msg_preparsed x 3,762 ops/sec ±4.35% (64 runs sampled)\r\nnew_complex_msg x 2,234 ops/sec ±20.57% (86 runs sampled)\r\nnew_string_msg x 141,100 ops/sec ±1.61% (91 runs sampled)\r\n\r\nAfter switching to Intl.NumberFormat.supportedLocalesOf():\r\n/m/c/s/intl-messageformat ❯❯❯ npm run benchmark\r\n\r\n> intl-messageformat@3.0.0 benchmark /mnt/c/src/intl-messageformat\r\n> ts-node --project tsconfig.all.json tests/benchmark\r\n\r\nformat_cached_complex_msg x 390,386 ops/sec ±1.39% (90 runs sampled)\r\nformat_cached_string_msg x 109,872,625 ops/sec ±1.34% (87 runs sampled)\r\nnew_complex_msg_preparsed x 4,073 ops/sec ±5.68% (73 runs sampled)\r\nnew_complex_msg x 2,115 ops/sec ±12.47% (83 runs sampled)\r\nnew_string_msg x 53,138 ops/sec ±0.41% (94 runs sampled)\r\n\r\nSeems like there's no impact on perf. This allows us to dist\r\nless things as well\r\n"
